   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2019-12-12",
   "text": "Gig Is Up Act\n This bill requires employers to pay employer and employee portions of Social Security and Medicare taxes when they contract with at least 10,000 independent contractors and gross at least $100 million in a calendar year."
